guide butler-routes-completionist/duskwood
title Duskwood - Completionist
levels 17-28
zone Duskwood
category Leveling
folder Completionist
coords live
version 1

step The west road - Sven's farm

  note In from Westfall along the west road: Sven Yorgen's farm and Lars' camp hold the border. Quests here run 17 to 28, with the Level 60 writs and twins as a special class - the steps say which legs belong to which level.
  accept 226 only Alliance -- Wolves at Our Heels - Lars; Starving and Rabid Dire Wolves, north-east
  complete 226 only Alliance @11,45 era -- Starving Dire Wolves for Lars
  complete 226 only Alliance @11,45 era -- Rabid Dire Wolves for Lars
  turnin 226 only Alliance -- Wolves at Our Heels - back to Lars
  accept 55 only Alliance -- Morbent Fel - Sven Yorgen; Morbent Fel himself, Raven Hill
  note 55's pre (325, Armed and Ready) lives in the Stormwind guide - take 55 after that leg.
  complete 55 only Alliance @16.9,33.4 era -- Morbent Fel for Sven Yorgen
  turnin 55 only Alliance -- Morbent Fel - back to Sven Yorgen

