step The mission board - Palandar's incursion

  note Field Captain Palandar holds the Nightmare board, central. Eighteen missions, no chains between them - take the board in one pass, work it by area, hand it all back at the end.
  accept 81730 -- Duskwood Mission I: Defeat Worgen - Field Captain Palandar; Runners and Weavers, the Rotting Orchard
  accept 81731 -- Duskwood Mission II: Defeat Ogres - Field Captain Palandar; ogres, Vul'gol
